    "title": "Survey Rewards by Ipsos iSay",
    "description": "Paid survey rewards community that\u2019s dedicated to giving you a voice - join Ipsos iSay today!\r\n\r\nSurvey apps can help you earn rewards in your spare time. Take a few minutes to share your opinions with companies and earn points in your account that you can exchange for rewards. Ipsos iSay is the most trusted paid survey app that you can rely on.\r\n\r\n<b>Get paid to take surveys in three easy steps:</b>\r\n1. Access exclusive mobile surveys\r\n2. Earn points for completed surveys\r\n3. Redeem your points for rewards\r\n\r\n<b>Surveys for Rewards</b>\r\n\u2022 Surveys on the go - anytime, anywhere\r\n\u2022 Take surveys for gift cards or rewards\r\n\u2022 Get instant survey notifications to take them before anyone else\r\n\r\n<b>Earn Rewards</b>\r\n\u2022 Opinions are valuable and help brands improve\r\n\u2022 Earn points as you finish surveys\r\n\u2022 Exchange your points for gift cards, cash or other rewards when you're ready\r\n\r\nDownload Ipsos iSay now and get paid to complete surveys!\r\n\r\nWe\u2019re powered by Ipsos, a leading global market research company that provides a fresh perspective on the issues and trends of today.",
